JMED-LLM (sociocom, NAIST), commit 3774a34e4a26a7b8a7851f421ecad91a04c2f59b
  https://github.com/sociocom/JMED-LLM
  Subsets used: MRNER-disease, MRNER-medicine, CRADE, RRTNM (CC BY 4.0); JMMLU-Med (CC BY-SA 4.0).
  Used for evaluation only.

NTCIR-16 Real-MedNLP test collection (MedTxt-CR-JA, MedTxt-RR-JA), CC BY 4.0
  https://sociocom.naist.jp/download/real-mednlp-test-collection/
  S. Yada, Y. Nakamura, S. Wakamiya, E. Aramaki. Real-MedNLP: Overview of REAL document-based
  MEDical Natural Language Processing Task. NTCIR-16, 2022.
  A subset of documents (those not overlapping JMED-LLM evaluation items) was converted into
  training examples.

NTCIR-17 MedNLP-SC RR-TNM, CC BY 4.0
  https://sociocom.naist.jp/download/mednlp-sc-rr-tnm/
  Y. Nakamura, S. Hanaoka, S. Yada, S. Wakamiya, E. Aramaki. NTCIR-17 MedNLP-SC Radiology Report
  Subtask Overview: Dataset and Solutions for Automated Lung Cancer Staging. NTCIR-17, 2023.
  Referenced for leakage analysis only (via JMED-LLM RRTNM).

JGLUE v1.3 (Yahoo Japan), commit 6f071c09316baae89c3d083a90985b4b1cb9968c, CC BY-SA 4.0
  https://github.com/yahoojapan/JGLUE
  K. Kurihara, D. Kawahara, T. Shibata. JGLUE: Japanese General Language Understanding Evaluation.
  LREC 2022.
  JCommonsenseQA and JNLI test splits, used for evaluation only.

JMMLU (Waseda University), CC BY-SA 4.0 (medical subjects, via JMED-LLM)
  https://github.com/nlp-waseda/JMMLU
  Used for evaluation only.

