Models
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Qwen3-8B (Alibaba Cloud), Apache License 2.0, revision b968826d9c46dd6066d109eabc6255188de91218
  https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-8B
  Base model of the LoRA adapter in experiments/01_finetuning/results/adapters/. The adapter is a
  derivative of Qwen3-8B and is provided under the Apache License 2.0.

Qwen3.8-27B-FP8 (Alibaba Cloud), Apache License 2.0 — used to generate synthetic training/test notes.
NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Lightning-30B-A3B-NVFP4 (NVIDIA), OpenMDW License 1.1 — used to generate the
  cross-generator test notes. The OpenMDW License places no restrictions on generated outputs.
Qwen3-Swallow-8B-RL-v0.2 and Medical-Qwen3-Swallow-8B (Swallow LLM Team), Apache License 2.0 —
  evaluated as comparison models; not redistributed.

No OpenAI model output was used to create training data. OpenAI models were queried for evaluation
only.
